      "value": "Similar post here:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/physbones-in-the-worlds-sdk\n\nThis must have been planned 2 years ago, but no news yet.\n\nhttps://medium.com/vrchat/vrchat-april-2021-dev-stream-recap-8502bb8c9163",
